---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="About the practitioner — an Associate Clinical Social Worker offering EMDR, somatic, and nature-based therapy in California.">

  <article class="about container-narrow section">
    <header class="about-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Therapy that meets you where you are.</h1>
    </header>

    <section class="prose">
      <p class="lede">
        I believe healing doesn't have to happen in a sterile office under
        fluorescent lights. Some of the most meaningful shifts happen when you
        feel grounded, safe, and connected — to your body, your environment,
        and yourself.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>Background</h2>
      <p>
        I'm an Associate Clinical Social Worker, and my work is rooted in
        understanding how the nervous system holds and processes experience.
        When something overwhelming happens, it doesn't just live in your
        thoughts — it lives in your body.
      </p>
      <p>
        That's why I integrate approaches like EMDR, somatic therapy, and
        nature-based practices. These methods help you move through what's
        stuck, rather than just talk about it.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="prose">
      <h2>How I work</h2>
      <p>
        I work in a way that is steady, collaborative, and attuned. You don't
        have to perform, explain everything perfectly, or have it all figured
        out.
      </p>
      <p>
        We go at a pace that feels safe for your system — building capacity,
        not pushing past your limits.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="prose closing">
      <p>
        Healing is not about becoming someone new.
        <br />
        It's about coming back to yourself.
      </p>
    </section>

    <aside class="credentials" aria-labelledby="credentials-heading">
      <h2 id="credentials-heading" class="eyebrow">Credentials &amp; supervision</h2>
      {/*
        BBS-required disclosure. Replace bracketed values with the
        practitioner's confirmed details before launch.
      */}
      <p>
        [Practitioner name], MSW, ASW #[ASW number]
        <br />
        Associate Clinical Social Worker, registered with the California Board of Behavioral Sciences
        <br />
        Supervised by [Supervisor name], LMFT #[LMFT number]
      </p>
    </aside>

    <div class="cta-row">
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary" data-cta="book-consult">Book a Consult</a>
    </div>
  </article>

</Base>

<style>
  .about-header { margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); }
  .about-header .eyebrow { margin-bottom: var(--space-2xs); }

  .prose { margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); }
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-h3);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xs);
  }

  .prose.closing p {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: var(--fs-h3);
    line-height: var(--lh-snug);
    color: var(--color-sage-deep);
  }

  .credentials {
    margin-block: var(--space-xl);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--color-sage-light);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .credentials .eyebrow { margin-bottom: var(--space-2xs); }

  .cta-row { margin-top: var(--space-lg); }
</style>
